[00:19.30]How does it make you feel
[00:23.26]when you preach and teach with zeal,
[00:27.60]When you know you’ve done your part
[00:31.22]to reach an honest heart?
[00:37.78]Knowing you’ve done your best;
[00:41.98]then our God will do the rest.
[00:46.72]Honest hearts he surely knows—
[00:49.80]all those to him disposed.
[00:55.49](Chorus)
[00:55.64]It makes us glad, and we rejoice
[00:59.32]to give our heart and mind and voice.
[01:04.96]So may our sacrifice of praise
[01:08.61]continue all our days.
[01:19.90]How does it make you feel
[01:23.84]when the words you speak appeal
[01:28.06]To the ones whose heart is right
[01:31.78]for everlasting life?
[01:38.38]Some people turn away,
[01:42.64]others might be led astray.
[01:47.14]Still we’re glad to bear his name
[01:50.48]and witness just the same.
[01:56.11](Chorus)
[01:56.26]It makes us glad, and we rejoice
[02:00.62]to give our heart and mind and voice.
[02:05.56]So may our sacrifice of praise
[02:09.22]continue all our days.
[03:01.24]How does it make you feel,
[03:05.22]knowing God’s support is real,
[03:09.74]And that he’s entrusted you
[03:13.08]to do the work we do?
[03:19.94]Proudly we preach and teach,
[03:23.86]using bold but gracious speech,
[03:28.70]Searching out deserving ones;
[03:31.80]this work will soon be done.
[03:37.29](Chorus)
[03:37.44]It makes us glad, and we rejoice
[03:41.92]to give our heart and mind and voice.
[03:46.72]So may our sacrifice of praise
[03:50.18]continue all our days.
